// 序列帧特效（2D 精灵材质）：黑底发光图按叠加混合，黑色即透明。color 的 alpha 可整体淡出。
CCEffect %{
  techniques:
  - passes:
    - vert: fx-vs:vert
      frag: fx-fs:frag
      depthStencilState:
        depthTest: false
        depthWrite: false
      blendState:
        targets:
        - blend: true
          blendSrc: one
          blendDst: one
          blendSrcAlpha: zero
          blendDstAlpha: one
      rasterizerState:
        cullMode: none
      properties:
        intensity: { value: 0.8 }
}%

CCProgram fx-vs %{
  precision highp float;
  #include <builtin/uniforms/cc-global>
  in vec3 a_position;
  in vec2 a_texCoord;
  in vec4 a_color;
  out vec4 color;
  out vec2 uv0;
  vec4 vert () {
    uv0 = a_texCoord;
    color = a_color;
    return cc_matViewProj * vec4(a_position, 1.0);
  }
}%

CCProgram fx-fs %{
  precision highp float;
  #include <builtin/internal/embedded-alpha>
  in vec4 color;
  in vec2 uv0;
  #pragma builtin(local)
  layout(set = 2, binding = 12) uniform sampler2D cc_spriteTexture;
  uniform Fx { float intensity; };
  vec4 frag () {
    vec4 o = CCSampleWithAlphaSeparated(cc_spriteTexture, uv0);
    return vec4(o.rgb * color.rgb * color.a * intensity, 1.0);
  }
}%
